# --- Personal / private journal material: NEVER commit ---
# Reference material used while designing the app (photos of handwritten
# journals, friends' journal samples). Kept locally, never in git.
#
# Images are blanket-ignored so a screenshot of a real entry can never be
# committed by accident. The documentation images are the one exception, and
# they are generated from invented sample content — see docs/images/README.md.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.heic
!docs/images/*.png
sample*.txt
vv
notes.private.*

# Local data: the SQLite DB, exported artifacts, user-defined templates.
data/
exports/

# Secrets
.env
.env.local

# Python
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Native IDE output, if an iOS/Android shell is ever added. Xcode and Android
# Studio both generate large machine-specific trees next to their project files.
node_modules/
dist/
DerivedData/
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
local.properties
.gradle/
build/
*.apk
*.aab
